{"seq":2,"slug":"bioaccumulation","title":"生物富集与放大","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/fate-exposure/bioaccumulation","wordCount":1883,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"生物富集与放大\">生物富集与放大</h1><p>北极熊体内某些 POPs 的浓度，可以比它栖息的海水高出几千万倍。这只熊从未接触过工厂，它的食物——海豹——也没有；浓度是沿着「海水→浮游生物→鱼→海豹→北极熊」的食物链一级一级累加上来的，每升一个营养级就被浓缩一次。这种把环境中痕量污染物层层放大、最终在顶级掠食者体内达到危险水平的现象，是环境毒理学最具警示意义的机制之一。它把 <a href=\"transport-transformation\">环境迁移与转化</a> 中描述的分配行为，从单个生物体扩展到整条食物网，也解释了为什么 <a href=\"../pollutants/persistent-organic\">持久性有机污染物</a> 和甲基汞的危害远超其环境浓度的暗示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「富集与放大」其实包含三个需要严格区分的概念，初学者常把它们混为一谈。**生物浓缩（bioconcentration）**指生物仅通过水/空气等环境介质直接吸收而使体内浓度高于环境的过程；**生物蓄积（bioaccumulation）**则把摄食途径也算进来，是生物从所有途径（介质+食物）净吸收的总和；**生物放大（biomagnification）**特指浓度沿食物链逐营养级升高的现象。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[环境介质中痕量污染物] --&gt; B[生物浓缩 BCF&lt;br/&gt;仅经介质直接吸收]&#10;  A --&gt; C[摄食途径]&#10;  B --&gt; D[生物蓄积 BAF&lt;br/&gt;介质+食物总吸收]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[生物放大 BMF&lt;br/&gt;沿营养级逐级升高]&#10;  E --&gt; F[顶级掠食者最高浓度]\">flowchart TD\n  A[环境介质中痕量污染物] --&gt; B[生物浓缩 BCF&lt;br/&gt;仅经介质直接吸收]\n  A --&gt; C[摄食途径]\n  B --&gt; D[生物蓄积 BAF&lt;br/&gt;介质+食物总吸收]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[生物放大 BMF&lt;br/&gt;沿营养级逐级升高]\n  E --&gt; F[顶级掠食者最高浓度]</pre><p>三者各有对应的定量指标，下表汇总。它们的高低主要由污染物的亲脂性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和抗代谢能力决定，前者的物理意义已在 <a href=\"transport-transformation\">环境迁移与转化</a> 中定义。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>判别阈值（参考）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BCF</td>\n<td>生物浓缩因子</td>\n<td>生物浓度 / 介质浓度（仅介质吸收）</td>\n<td>&gt;2000 提示关注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BAF</td>\n<td>生物蓄积因子</td>\n<td>生物浓度 / 介质浓度（含摄食）</td>\n<td>&gt;5000 提示高蓄积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BMF</td>\n<td>生物放大因子</td>\n<td>捕食者浓度 / 被捕食者浓度</td>\n<td>&gt;1 表示发生放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TMF</td>\n<td>营养级放大因子</td>\n<td>浓度随营养级的回归斜率</td>\n<td>&gt;1 表示食物网放大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"决定蓄积的两个关键属性-亲脂与难代谢\">决定蓄积的两个关键属性：亲脂与难代谢</h2><p>为什么有的污染物会蓄积放大，有的不会？根本上取决于两件事的组合：物质多容易进入并留在生物体内（吸收与分布），以及多难被清除（代谢与排泄）。</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>亲脂性</strong>。高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的物质倾向于溶入生物体的脂肪而非随水排出，这与 <a href=\"../foundations/adme\">吸收分布代谢排泄</a> 中分布容积的逻辑一致——亲脂物质大量离开血液、蓄积于脂肪组织。但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与蓄积并非单调正相关：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极高（大于约 7）的超大分子反而难以跨越生物膜，蓄积潜力下降，因此最强的蓄积者往往集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 介于 5 到 7 的「窗口」内。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>抗代谢与抗排泄能力</strong>，即长生物半衰期。即便一个物质很亲脂，若机体能迅速把它代谢成水溶性产物排出，它也无法蓄积。POPs 之所以是蓄积冠军，正因为它们既亲脂又极难被代谢，<a href=\"../foundations/adme\">吸收分布代谢排泄</a> 中以年计的半衰期使得「吸收速率持续大于清除速率」，浓度便随时间单调累积。</p>\n<p>一个稳态浓缩可近似表示为吸收速率常数与清除速率常数之比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{BCF} \\approx \\frac{k_1}{k_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">BCF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是从介质吸收的速率常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是清除（含代谢+排泄）的速率常数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大（亲脂）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 小（难代谢），BCF 就高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生物放大-为何顶级掠食者最危险\">生物放大：为何顶级掠食者最危险</h2><p>生物浓缩发生在单个生物体内，生物放大则是食物链层面的累加效应。其机制可以这样理解：捕食者吃下许多被捕食者，把它们体内蓄积的污染物一并摄入，而捕食者排出污染物的速度远慢于摄入速度，于是污染物在捕食者体内净增。每升高一个营养级，浓度就被乘以一个大于 1 的生物放大因子，经过几个营养级的连乘，顶端浓度可比基底高出几个数量级。</p>\n<p>这解释了若干经典环境事件。甲基汞在水生食物链的放大，使大型掠食性鱼类（金枪鱼、剑鱼）体内汞浓度远高于海水，这是 <a href=\"../pollutants/heavy-metals\">重金属与类金属</a> 中孕妇被建议限食某些鱼类的根源。DDT 的放大曾使猛禽体内浓度高到干扰钙代谢、导致蛋壳变薄而种群崩溃，这一生态后果属 <a href=\"../risk/ecological-risk\">生态风险评估</a> 关注的种群效应。</p>\n<p>并非所有污染物都会放大。亲脂的有机 POPs 和甲基汞会，但许多无机金属（如无机汞、镉）在食物链中可能不放大甚至「生物稀释」，因为生物对它们有金属硫蛋白等调控与排泄机制。形态在这里再次起决定作用，呼应 <a href=\"../pollutants/heavy-metals\">重金属与类金属</a> 的核心论点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"食物网视角与营养级放大因子\">食物网视角与营养级放大因子</h2><p>单一捕食-被捕食对的 BMF 难以刻画复杂的真实食物网，因为生物往往杂食、营养级是连续的。现代研究用**营养级放大因子（TMF）**从食物网整体刻画放大趋势：先用稳定氮同位素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>15</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta^{15}\\mathrm{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 测定每个物种的实际营养级，再把污染物浓度的对数对营养级做线性回归，回归斜率即代表「每升高一个营养级浓度放大的倍数」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[采集食物网各物种样本] --&gt; B[测氮同位素定营养级]&#10;  A --&gt; C[测各物种污染物浓度]&#10;  B --&gt; D[lg浓度 对 营养级 线性回归]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[斜率 -&gt; TMF]&#10;  E --&gt; F{TMF&gt;1?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[食物网整体放大]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[无放大或稀释]\">graph TD\n  A[采集食物网各物种样本] --&gt; B[测氮同位素定营养级]\n  A --&gt; C[测各物种污染物浓度]\n  B --&gt; D[lg浓度 对 营养级 线性回归]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[斜率 -&gt; TMF]\n  E --&gt; F{TMF&gt;1?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[食物网整体放大]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[无放大或稀释]</pre><p>TMF 大于 1 即表明该污染物在整个食物网中放大，是当前判定生物放大潜力最被认可的野外证据，比单一 BMF 更稳健。它把分子层面的蓄积、个体层面的动力学与种群层面的暴露统一在一条回归线上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在风险评估中的意义\">在风险评估中的意义</h2><p>生物富集与放大是连接「环境浓度低」与「危害大」之间的关键桥梁，对风险评估有直接而深远的影响。其一，它使监管不能只看环境介质浓度——即使水中污染物浓度远低于直接毒性阈值，经放大后在食物中仍可能超标，因此鱼类等食物中的浓度往往是更相关的暴露指标，这是 <a href=\"exposure-assessment\">暴露评估</a> 中食物摄入途径权重很高的原因。</p>\n<p>其二，BCF/BAF 是 POPs 筛选与化学品管理的法定判据之一，<a href=\"../pollutants/persistent-organic\">持久性有机污染物</a> 四特征中的「生物蓄积性」正用这些指标量化，<a href=\"../risk/testing-regulation\">毒理学测试与法规</a> 中的化学品注册要求提交相关数据。其三，放大效应使顶级掠食者（包括人类）成为最脆弱的受体，这是 <a href=\"../risk/human-health-risk\">人体健康风险</a> 评估膳食暴露时的核心考量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生物浓缩、生物蓄积、生物放大三概念需严格区分，分别对应介质吸收、总吸收和食物链放大。</li>\n<li>蓄积取决于亲脂性与难代谢性的组合，最强蓄积者集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 约 5–7 的窗口内。</li>\n<li>稳态浓缩可近似为吸收速率与清除速率之比，POPs 因既亲脂又难代谢而成为蓄积冠军。</li>\n<li>生物放大使浓度沿营养级连乘升高，顶级掠食者浓度可比环境高几个数量级。</li>\n<li>形态决定是否放大：有机 POPs 和甲基汞放大，许多无机金属反而被生物稀释。</li>\n<li>TMF 用氮同位素与回归从食物网整体判定放大，是最稳健的野外证据，也是风险评估的关键输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生物富集与放大","id":"生物富集与放大"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"决定蓄积的两个关键属性：亲脂与难代谢","id":"决定蓄积的两个关键属性-亲脂与难代谢"},{"level":2,"text":"生物放大：为何顶级掠食者最危险","id":"生物放大-为何顶级掠食者最危险"},{"level":2,"text":"食物网视角与营养级放大因子","id":"食物网视角与营养级放大因子"},{"level":2,"text":"在风险评估中的意义","id":"在风险评估中的意义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"环境迁移与转化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/fate-exposure/transport-transformation"},"next":{"title":"暴露评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/fate-exposure/exposure-assessment"}}